WEBVTT

00:01:55.695 --> 00:02:00.616
like cryptocurrencies and geoengineering

00:02:00.658 --> 00:02:03.452
and plant-based meat.

00:02:04.036 --> 00:02:10.626
I also recently learned that there is
a zero-sugar, alcoholic version

00:02:10.626 --> 00:02:14.714
of Taco Bell's Baja Blast Mountain Dew.

00:02:14.755 --> 00:02:15.756
(Laughter)

00:02:15.756 --> 00:02:17.008
And I don't actually know

00:02:17.049 --> 00:02:19.218
if that's a point for
or against my argument,

00:02:19.218 --> 00:02:20.970
but I did feel like you should know.

00:02:21.012 --> 00:02:22.763
(Laughter)

00:02:23.222 --> 00:02:26.017
So, amongst all of this miraculous
market activity,

00:02:26.058 --> 00:02:28.144
we also have government,

00:02:28.186 --> 00:02:30.646
and that means we have two problems.